The half adder is implemented using an XOR gate for the sum (sum is 1 when exactly one input is 1) and an AND gate for the carry-out (carry is 1 only when both inputs are 1). The code compiled without errors.

```verilog
module TopModule (
    input  a,
    input  b,
    output sum,
    output cout
);

    assign sum  = a ^ b;
    assign cout = a & b;

endmodule
```
